@anon.8ad231a129453d088979dfad2582f60a.1112 = private unnamed_addr constant [484 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for uses of deprecated Airflow functions and values.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AAirflow 3.0 removed various deprecated functions, members, and other\0Avalues. Some have more modern replacements. Others are considered too niche\0Aand not worth to be maintained in Airflow.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Afrom airflow.utils.dates import days_ago\0A\0A\0Ayesterday = days_ago(today, 1)\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Afrom datetime import timedelta\0A\0A\0Ayesterday = today - timedelta(days=1)\0A```\0A", align 1
