(https://peps.python.org/pep-0257/)\0A- [PEP 287 \E2\80\93 reStructuredText Docstring Format](https://peps.python.org/pep-0287/)\0A- [NumPy Style Guide](https://numpydoc.readthedocs.io/en/latest/format.html)\0A- [Google Python Style Guide - Docstrings](https://google.github.io/styleguide/pyguide.html#38-comments-and-docstrings)\0A", align 1
